file tools/fixtures/r/rye_build.sh the walk that locks every room a build writes into
file tools/fixtures/r/rye_build_control.sh five legs proving the imported room is covered
scope four rooms migrated to the lock, the lock widened to cover imported rooms, proven on a real cross-room build
status GREEN on the control at fifteen legs and on spot-checked witnesses in each room; one unexplained failure reported rather than rounded away
recommend check in (Keaton) -- linengrow and the smaller rooms still build unlocked, and the survivor wants one captured failure like its predecessor did
